# The browsers this demo is built for. Without them the build assumes the
# newest release of every engine, which drops vendor prefixes that phones in
# use still read: it took `-webkit-text-size-adjust` out of the stylesheet, and
# iOS Safari then sized every line of a highlighted code block on its own.
#
# This is the set Tailwind CSS 4 itself supports, so both demos hold the same
# line.
chrome >= 111
edge >= 111
firefox >= 128
safari >= 16.4
ios_saf >= 16.4
